From 7f815108d6d407c1e1d56d910d9b1972c6ee05a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 11 May 2026 22:38:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate off Manus runtime: Render + TiDB + Stripe Checkout

Phase 1: Strip Manus Vite plugins, debug collector, jsx-loc, and umami
analytics from vite.config.ts / client/index.html.

Phase 2: Replace Manus OAuth with an ADMIN_PASSWORD login. /api/admin/login
issues a jose-signed HS256 session cookie; createContext now returns a
synthetic admin User when the cookie verifies, null otherwise. New
/admin/login client page wires it up.

Phase 3: Stub out Forge-tied modules. notifyOwner is a console.log; storagePut
throws a clear "configure an R2/S3 backend" error. Delete unused Manus core
modules (dataApi, heartbeat, imageGeneration, llm, map, voiceTranscription),
storageProxy, oauth, manusTypes.

Phase 4: Rewrite seed-real-products.mjs image paths to /products/*.jpg and
create the client/public/products/ directory. Original .jpgs need to be
dropped in before db seed.

Phase 5: Add Stripe Checkout. New checkout.createStripeSession tRPC mutation
builds a hosted Checkout Session from the order + items. POST /api/stripe/
webhook (registered before express.json with raw body parser) verifies the
signature and marks the order PAID + CONFIRMED on checkout.session.completed.
Checkout page now redirects to Stripe; new /order/:orderNumber page handles
the success_url landing.

Phase 6: Add render.yaml for the Render web service with envVars stubs for
DATABASE_URL, ADMIN_PASSWORD, ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET, STRIPE_SECRET_KEY,
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET, BASE_URL.

pnpm build / pnpm check / pnpm test all pass.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vg276JxJYqUgesXZMi3EVt
